        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 5:43PM PDT until September 24 at 5:45PM PDT by NWS Las Vegas NV</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 545 PM PDT this afternoon for a
portion of southern California, including the following area, San
Bernardino.

The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.
